Assertion (A): Selective mutism is the same as being shy
Reason (R): Selective mutism: consistent failure to speak in specific social situations despite speaking in others;
it is an anxiety disorder

Assertion (A): Social workers working with refugees need trauma and cultural competence
Reason (R): Refugees: multiple traumas, resettlement stress, language barriers, cultural displacement;
specialised skills needed

Assertion (A): POCSO mandates child-friendly investigation procedures
Reason (R): Police cannot interrogate child in uniform; no multiple depositions; support person present;
child-friendly space

Assertion (A): Treatment of childhood anxiety should involve parents
Reason (R): Parent involvement: modifying parental accommodation of avoidance; skills transfer;
psychoeducation
